  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1e1e2e;\n  --card: #2a2a3c;\n  --text: #e0def4;\n  --accent: #f5a97f;\n  --btn: #3e3e5c;\n  --btn-hover: #4e4e6c;\n  --btn-active: #5e5e7c;\n  --focus: #f5a97f;\n}\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #11111b;\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  padding: 8px;\n  background: #1e1e2e;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 2px solid #11111b;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\nbutton {\n  font: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: var(--btn);\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #11111b;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n  min-width: 80px;\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n}\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--btn-hover);\n}\nbutton:active {\n  background: var(--btn-active);\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #11111b;\n}\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\nbutton:focus:not(:focus-visible) {\n  outline: none;\n}\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  #count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction render() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count++;\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count--;\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  render();\n});\n\nrender();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Offline Pixel Counter\n\nA dependency-free, offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial value: 0\n- Increase (+1), decrease (-1), and reset to 0\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible buttons with visible focus states\n- Responsive layout from 360px wide\n- No storage, network requests, or external assets\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Click the buttons or use Tab + Enter/Space to interact.\n\n## Controls\n\n| Button ID | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| `increase` | Adds 1 to the count |\n| `decrease` | Subtracts 1 from the count |\n| `reset` | Sets the count to 0 |\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All buttons have `aria-label` attributes.\n- The count output uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` for screen reader updates.\n- Focus outlines are clearly visible.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – markup\n- `style.css` – pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` – counter logic\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
